# Your lawyer, in the visiting room or on the courthouse steps: the bail
# hearing, the case, the motions, the plea, a deal, the trial, the appeal.
# (Fiction; the lawyers and judges are invented.) Reads and acts through
# Talk.State: post_bail(), hire(), move(), lean_on_witness(), pay_judge(),
# plead(), cooperate(), appeal(), wait().

~ start
if not court or not case_open
	=> no_case
if stage == "bail"
	=> bail
if stage == "prison"
	=> prison
if stage == "fugitive"
	=> fugitive
=> consult

~ no_case
Arturo Vega: [[You're not in trouble. Keep it that way.|No case, no fee. Call me when they call you.]]
=> END

~ bail
{{lawyer_name}}: You're charged with {{charges}}. {{judge}} has the bail hearing - {{judge_known}}.
if no_bail
	{{lawyer_name}}: The prosecutor called you a flight risk and the judge agreed. No bail. You're held until trial.
	- All right.
		do post_bail("custody")
		=> END
{{lawyer_name}}: Bail is {{money_s(bail)}}. Post it all and you get it back if you show up for trial. A bondsman wants ten percent - {{money_s(bond)}} - and you never see it again.
- Post the full bail. ({{money_s(bail)}}) [if money >= bail]
	do post_bail("cash")
	=> bailed
- Get a bondsman. ({{money_s(bond)}}) [if money >= bond]
	do post_bail("bond")
	=> bailed
- Sit tight in custody.
	do post_bail("custody")
	{{lawyer_name}}: Then get comfortable. The trial's in {{trial_min}} minutes.
	=> END

~ bailed
if result != ""
	{{lawyer_name}}: {{result}}
	=> END
{{lawyer_name}}: You're out. Don't get arrested again, and don't be anywhere but that courtroom in {{trial_min}} minutes.
=> END

~ consult
if stage == "custody"
	Narrator: The visiting room. Green paint, a steel table, a guard by the door.
{{lawyer_name}}: [[So.|Sit down.|Here's where we are.]] {{charges}}. {{judge}} - {{judge_known}}. Trial in {{trial_min}} minutes.
if odds >= 0
	{{lawyer_name}}: I've seen their file. The case is {{strength}}: I'd put a conviction at {{odds}} percent. {{witnesses}} witnesses.
	if informant
		{{lawyer_name}}: And one of them is an informant. Somebody close to you.
else
	{{lawyer_name}}: Their case looks {{strength}} from here. I'd know more with discovery.
if has_plea
	{{lawyer_name}}: There's an offer on the table: plead to {{plea_charge}}, {{plea_years}} years.
=> options

~ options
- Hire Arturo Vega. ($6,000) [if lawyer_tier == "public"]
	do hire("local")
	=> hired
- Hire Roy Kessler, the Brickell Avenue lawyer. ($25,000) [if lawyer_tier == "public" or lawyer_tier == "local"]
	do hire("miami")
	=> hired
- File a motion to suppress the search. ($3,000) [if not has_filed("suppress")]
	do move("suppress")
	=> filed
- Ask for discovery. ($1,500) [if not has_filed("discovery")]
	do move("discovery")
	=> filed
- Ask for more time. ($2,000) [if continuances < 2]
	do move("continuance")
	=> filed
- Take the plea. [if has_plea]
	do plead()
	=> plea
- "What about the witness?" [if witnesses > 0 and not tampered]
	=> witness
- "What about the judge?" [if bribable and not bribed]
	=> judge_talk
- "What if I talked to them? Named names?"
	=> deal
- Wait for the trial. [if stage == "custody"]
	do wait()
	=> END
- That's all for now.
	{{lawyer_name}}: [[Don't talk to anyone. Anyone.|Keep your head down.|I'll see you in court.]]
	=> END

~ hired
if result != ""
	{{lawyer_name}}: {{result}}
else
	{{lawyer_name}}: [[Let's get to work.|Good. Now tell me everything - and I mean everything.]]
=> options

~ filed
if result != ""
	{{lawyer_name}}: {{result}}
else
	{{lawyer_name}}: [[Filed.|It's in front of the judge.|Done. We'll see.]]
=> consult

~ plea
{{lawyer_name}}: It's done. You pleaded. {{years}} years - better than it could have been.
=> END

~ witness
{{lawyer_name}}: (quietly) I didn't hear this conversation. But certain friends of yours could... discourage a witness. If it goes wrong it's obstruction of justice, and you go back in.
- Make the call. ($5,000 to the Family)
	do lean_on_witness()
	if result != ""
		{{lawyer_name}}: {{result}}
	=> consult
- Forget it.
	=> options

~ judge_talk
{{lawyer_name}}: {{judge}} has a boat, a condo in Key Biscayne and a judge's salary. People have... helped him before. Twenty thousand, cash. If it's a sting, you're finished.
- Do it. ($20,000)
	do pay_judge()
	if result != ""
		{{lawyer_name}}: {{result}}
	=> consult
- No.
	=> options

~ deal
{{lawyer_name}}: A cooperation agreement. You give them the organisation - the strips, the stash houses, the people. You'd do a tenth of the time. And you'd spend the rest of your life looking over your shoulder. The Family would know within a day.
- Sign it.
	do cooperate()
	{{lawyer_name}}: It's done. God help you.
	=> END
- Never.
	{{lawyer_name}}: Good. I didn't want to hear it.
	=> options

~ prison
Narrator: {{verdict}}: {{years}} years. {{release_min}} minutes left inside.
- Appeal. ($8,000) [if not appealed]
	do appeal()
	if result != ""
		{{lawyer_name}}: {{result}}
	=> END
- Do the time.
	do wait()
	=> END
- Not now.
	=> END

~ fugitive
{{lawyer_name}}: (on a bad line) There's a warrant. The bail's gone. If you come back, they'll be waiting at every airfield with a police post. Stay where you are.
=> END
